  "item_short_desc": "<p>Get ready to fight the cold with our ECWCS Gen III Level II Underwear Crew Top. Made from breathable, mid-weight grid fleece material that is great for layering, the thermal military shirt is designed to keep you warm, comfortable, and dry, even in the harshest winter weather. The waffle thermal also features anti-microbial and anti-odor defense, ensuring that you stay fresh and clean through winter combat missions and cold weather activities.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133054",
  "description": "<p>Get ready to fight the cold with our ECWCS Gen III Level II Underwear Crew Top. Made from breathable, mid-weight grid fleece material that is great for layering, the thermal military shirt is designed to keep you warm, comfortable, and dry, even in the harshest winter weather. The waffle thermal also features anti-microbial and anti-odor defense, ensuring that you stay fresh and clean through winter combat missions and cold weather activities. Stay Warm &amp; Dry: The base layer t-shirt wicks sweat and moisture away for optimum comfort, swiftly transferring it to the top layer for a quick dry. This allows you to move freely without your clothing sticking to you, ideal for winter operations, hiking, camping, skiing, snowboarding, hunting, and other outdoor activities. Comfortable Fit: Built from a soft polyester / spandex blend, the grid fleece fabric easily flexes and contorts with your body for optimum comfort. The extended back tail ensures total coverage when crouching or moving, while the thumb holes keep your sleeves in place. Active-Duty Approved: The crew neck shirt is part of the Extended Cold Weather Clothing System (ECWCS) and is a must-have for any military personnel, tactical professional, or outdoor enthusiast in cold climates. Whether you are gearing up for a mission or camping up in the mountains, you will want to keep a pair on you. Better Together: Stay warm and comfortable this winter with our matching ECWCS Gen III Level II Underwear Bottoms. The base layer pants feature the same breathable, mid-weight grid fleece material as the top, ensuring that you&rsquo;re ready for the mission at hand.</p>",
